@AuctionKings.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5081

### Register a Bidder account (201 + access token)
POST {{AuctionKings.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ann@example.com",
  "displayName": "Ann",
  "password": "correct horse battery staple"
}

### Sign in (200 + access token; 401 on wrong email or password)
# @name login
POST {{AuctionKings.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ann@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery staple"
}

### Use the token
GET {{AuctionKings.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{login.response.body.$.user.id}}/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
